OL,3,GNEWSAMulti-vehicle crash causes M1
OL,4,Atailbacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists have been facing delays after
OL,7,Fa multi-vehicle crash on the M1 in
OL,8,FLeicestershire.
OL,10,FThe motorway was closed northbound,
OL,11,Fbetween junction 21A at Leicester and
OL,12,Fjunction 22 at Coalville, following the
OL,13,Fcrash, shortly before 14:00 BST,
OL,14,FNational Highways said.
OL,16,FPolice and the Air Ambulance Service
OL,17,Fwere both called to the scene of the
OL,18,Fcollision, they said.
OL,20,FThe southbound carriage was also
OL,21,Fclosed, but authorities reopened it
OL,22,Fshortly after 14:30.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
